      "heading": "Fulbright webinar,Monday, 30 October 2023, 16.00–17.00.",
      "text": "- develop curricula and workforce\n\n- engage in strategic or institutional planning\n\n- give lectures and workshops\n\n- Grants for studying or doing research in the U.S. for 4 to 10 months\n\n- Any university and faculty in the United States.\n\n- Support with your university application and J1 visa\n\n- Become part of the global alumni network"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Fulbright Specialist Program",
      "text": "Invite a U.S. academic or professional for 2 to 6 weeks to your institute to:\n\nhttps://fulbrightspecialist.worldlearning.org"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Fulbright Student & Scholar Grant",
      "text": "https://ch.usembassy.gov/education-culture/fulbright/\n\nTo register, please e-mail to request the webinar link."
    }
